"اُصْدُدْ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/00eb4ce931ecf0899d2a.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anti", "arabic": "صُدِّي", "plain": "صُدِّي", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/8ad96c5ca8acb324102a.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antuma", "arabic": "صُدَّا", "plain": "صُدَّا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/6159e8581d32aa91540f.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "arabic": "صُدُّوا", "plain": "صُدُّوا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/b53b74d8750efba26126.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antunna", "arabic": "اُصْدُدْنَ", "plain": "اُصْدُدْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/c4a42bdf097b9a047640.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "43:37", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4362.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And lo! they surely turn them from the way of Allah, and yet they deem that they are rightly guided;", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Şüphesiz ki bu şeytanlar onları yoldan çıkarırlar. Onlar da kendilerinin doğru yolda olduklarını sanırlar.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور بیشک وہ شیاطین ان کو راہ سے روکتے ہیں اور سمجھتے یہ ہیں کہ وہ راہ پر ہیں،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan sesungguhnya syaitan-syaitan itu benar-benar menghalangi mereka dari jalan yang benar dan mereka menyangka bahwa mereka mendapat petunjuk.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَإِنَّهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَيَصُدُّونَهُمْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/11da0c54bc468ac66c1b.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "sigurno ih odvraćaju", "en": "surely they turn them away", "tr": "onları mutlaka çevirirler", "fr": "certes ils les détournent", "id": "sungguh mereka memalingkan mereka", "ur": "وہ ضرور انہیں روکتے ہیں", "bn": "অবশ্যই তারা তাদের ফিরিয়ে রাখে", "fa": "قطعاً آنان را بازمی‌دارند"}}, {"text": "عَنِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلسَّبِيلِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَيَحْسَبُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَنَّهُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّهْتَدُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "47:1", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4546.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Those who disbelieve and turn (men) from the way of Allah, He rendereth their actions vain.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "İnkâr edenlerin ve Allah yolundan alıkoyanların amellerini Allah boşa çıkarır.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "جنہوں نے کفر کیا اور اللہ کی راہ سے روکا اللہ نے ان کے عمل برباد کیے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Orang-orang yang kafir dan menghalangi (manusia) dari jalan Allah, Allah menyesatkan perbuatan-perbuatan mereka.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَفَرُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَصَدُّوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/24c348b611801b8f3017.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i odvraćali su", "en": "and turned (others) away", "tr": "ve çevirdiler", "fr": "et ont détourné (les autres)", "id": "dan memalingkan (yang lain)", "ur": "اور انہوں نے روکا", "bn": "এবং তারা (অন্যদের) ফিরিয়ে রেখেছে", "fa": "و بازداشتند"}}, {"text": "عَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "سَبِيلِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَضَلَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَعْمَٰلَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "4:55", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/548.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And of them were (some) who believed therein and of them were (some) who turned away from it. Hell is sufficient for (their) burning.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "İşte o yahudilerden bir kısmı ona iman etti. Bir kısmı da ondan yüz çevirdi. O iman etmeyenlere cehennem alevi yeter.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو ان میں کوئی اس پر ایمان لایا اور کسی نے اس سے منہ پھیرا اور دوزخ کافی ہے بھڑکتی آگ", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka di antara mereka (orang-orang yang dengki itu), ada orang-orang yang beriman kepadanya, dan di antara mereka ada orang-orang yang menghalangi (manusia) dari beriman kepadanya. Dan cukuplah (bagi mereka) Jahannam yang menyala-nyala apinya.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَمِنْهُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَّنْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ءَامَنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِهِۦ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَمِنْهُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَّن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "صَدَّ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/936f9597d1473774bf0f.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "he/it turned away", "bs": "odvratio je", "tr": "alıkoydu", "fr": "il a détourné", "id": "dia telah memalingkan", "ur": "اُس نے روکا", "bn": "সে ফিরিয়ে দিল", "fa": "بازداشت"}}, {"text": "عَنْهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَكَفَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِجَهَنَّمَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "سَعِيرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "43:62", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4387.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And let not Satan turn you aside. Lo! he is an open enemy for you.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Sakın şeytan sizi doğru yoldan alıkoymasın. Gerçekten o sizin için apaçık bir düşmandır.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور ہرگز شیطان تمہیں نہ روک دے بیشک وہ تمہارا کھلا دشمن ہے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan janganlah kamu sekali-kali dipalingkan oleh syaitan; sesungguhnya syaitan itu musuh yang nyata bagimu.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَصُدَّنَّكُمُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/766c6448d1357b8eb16a.m4a", "gloss": null, "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["antum"], "mood": "indicative"}]}, {"text": "ٱلشَّيْطَٰنُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِنَّهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَدُوٌّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّبِينٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "يَصُدُّونَ", "count": 5, "first": "4:61", "audio": "audio/5ec6c9618f2772b3dcbc.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "they turn away", "bs": "odvraćaju", "tr": "alıkoyarlar", "fr": "